    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #310\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-225-module-contract-08-12-formalize-the-un-thr_s9cfdar3ej`.\n\nSummary of the change (issue #225, module-contract 08/12):\n\n- Split the single `vitest.config.ts` into `vitest.unit.config.ts` (no DB, matches `*.unit.test.ts`) and `vitest.integration.config.ts` (ephemeral real Postgres via the existing `globalSetup`, matches everything else), with new `test:unit` / `test:integration` / `test` (both) scripts in `backend/package.json`.\n- Tagged the two already DB-free suites (`nextFireAt`, `imapIdleClient`) as unit tests, and added new unit coverage for the filter-tree compiler and the property-type migration's pure conversion functions (exporting `convertPropertyValue` for that purpose, refactored behavior-preserving).\n- Added integration coverage for a genuinely concurrent idempotency-key race and for two concurrent runs of the same property-type migration job converging on one consistent result (the closest available analog to the issue's suggested `#111`/`#112` concurrency examples, since those parts aren't merged into `develop` yet).\n- Verified: `pnpm run test` (unit + integration) passes — 4 files/26 tests (unit, no DB) and 22 files/305 tests (integration, real Postgres) — and `tsc --noEmit` is clean.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
