    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #310\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nNothing new to commit — the working tree was already clean, and the branch `bb/relay-225-module-contract-08-12-formalize-the-un-thr_s9cfdar3ej` is already pushed and up to date on origin (includes the earlier feature commit plus the `develop` merge conflict resolution from the previous step).\n\n**Branch:** `bb/relay-225-module-contract-08-12-formalize-the-un-thr_s9cfdar3ej`\n\nSummary of the work on issue #225:\n\n- Split `backend/vitest.config.ts` into `vitest.unit.config.ts` (no DB, `*.unit.test.ts`) and `vitest.integration.config.ts` (ephemeral real Postgres via the existing `globalSetup`, everything else), with `test:unit` / `test:integration` / `test` (both) scripts in `backend/package.json`, merged alongside develop's `check:boundaries` / `migrate` scripts.\n- Added unit coverage for the filter-tree compiler and the property-type migration's pure conversion functions (`convertPropertyValue`), and tagged all genuinely DB-free test files (including several added later by other merged PRs) as `*.unit.test.ts`.\n- Added integration coverage for a genuinely concurrent idempotency-key race and for two concurrent runs of the same property-type migration job converging on one consistent result.\n- Resolved the `develop` merge conflict in `backend/package.json` by keeping both branches' scripts.\n- Verified: `pnpm run test` (unit tier 9 files/83 tests, integration tier 27 files/364 tests) passes, `tsc --noEmit` is clean, and `pnpm -r run build` succeeds.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
